                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e76f4aed-7c03-31dc-b71b-b809c9d28a26",
                        "entry_id": "03b66849-ccae-31a9-b98a-fe03516fd929",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to be based / founded (on), to rest (on)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "04926f20-01d4-49fa-a42c-06b6b531e815",
                                "sense_id": "e76f4aed-7c03-31dc-b71b-b809c9d28a26",
                                "text": "Си́ла бойцо́в зи́ждется на ве́ре в побе́ду.",
                                "translation": "The strength of the fighters is based on the belief in the victory.",
                                "english": "The strength of the fighters is based on the belief in the victory."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a3c9506-ac19-451c-9053-2182ea49b8a6",
                                "sense_id": "e76f4aed-7c03-31dc-b71b-b809c9d28a26",
                                "text": "Столп, на кото́ром зи́ждется мирозда́ние",
                                "translation": "The pillar on which the universe rests.",
                                "english": "The pillar on which the universe rests."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8dfa13f-d007-44da-9206-48fe5ed30393",
                                "sense_id": "e76f4aed-7c03-31dc-b71b-b809c9d28a26",
                                "text": "Я хочу́ ви́деть свои́ми глаза́ми, как лань ля́жет по́дле льва и как заре́занный вста́нет и обни́мется с уби́вшим его́. Я хочу́ быть тут, когда́ все вдруг узна́ют, для чего́ всё так бы́ло. На э́том жела́нии зи́ждутся все рели́гии на земле́, а я ве́рую.",
                                "translation": "I want to see with my own eyes, how the doe lies down beside the lion, and how the slain man rises up and embraces his killer. I want to be there, when everyone suddenly learns what it was all for. On this desire are based all religions in the world, and I believe.",
                                "english": "I want to see with my own eyes, how the doe lies down beside the lion, and how the slain man rises up and embraces his killer. I want to be there, when everyone suddenly learns what it was all for. On this desire are based all religions in the world, and I believe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
